@startuml
title CON-SD-D05 Vendor PMS / HCP Degraded Resolve Decision Flow
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Vendor PMS Connector" as Connector
participant "Projection context" as Projection
participant "Operator Console /\ngovernance" as OC
participant "Audit / Reconciliation" as Audit

Central -> Connector : request live resolve / fee
Connector -> Vendor : vendor interaction
alt live result available
  Vendor --> Connector : session + fee facts
  Connector --> Central : normalized result
  Central -> Central : record payable basis
else unavailable / timeout / ambiguous
  Connector --> Central : normalized failure + health/freshness facts
  Central -> Projection : request projection support context
  Projection --> Central : freshness / mapping / sufficiency context
  alt approved policy + safe projection + approved degraded basis
    Central -> Central : degraded resolve decision
    Central -> Audit : incident/audit/reconciliation tags
  else unsafe or outside policy
    Central -> OC : fail closed or governance review
  end
end

note bottom
Connector reports facts only.
Central PMS owns degraded resolve decisioning.
end note
@enduml
